; Running-balance fixture (plan 36): the hledger parity golden and the engine
; tests read this. Root under test: assets:bank (checking + savings + a
; brokerage-ish EUR leg). Deliberately written OUT of date order, with
; same-day ties, posting-dated legs, an include, virtual postings, costs and
; assertions (passing, failing, and an `==` zero-check failure).
;
; Under an `errors/` directory because `hledger check` REJECTS it (the failing
; assertions are the point), so balance_assertions.rs' all-fixtures sweep skips it.

commodity $1,000.00
commodity 1.000,00 EUR

2026-01-01 opening
    assets:bank:checking        $1,000.00
    assets:bank:savings         $5,000.00
    equity:opening

2026-01-05 coffee (same day 1)
    expenses:food                  $4.50
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-05 lunch (same day 2)
    expenses:food                 $12.25
    assets:bank:checking          = $983.25

; written after a later-dated transaction would be: out of file order
2026-01-20 transfer to savings
    assets:bank:savings          $200.00
    assets:bank:checking        $-200.00

2026-01-10 euro deposit
    assets:bank:checking        100,00 EUR
    income:gift                -100,00 EUR

2026-01-10 cheque, bank leg clears later
    expenses:rent                $500.00
    assets:bank:checking        $-500.00  ; date:2026-01-25

2026-01-12 split clearing dates
    expenses:misc                 $30.00
    assets:bank:checking         $-10.00  ; date:2026-01-14
    assets:bank:savings          $-20.00  ; date:2026-01-22

2026-01-15 buy euros at a cost
    assets:bank:checking         50,00 EUR @ $1.10
    assets:bank:checking         $-55.00

2026-01-15 virtual adjustments
    (assets:bank:checking)         $1.00
    [assets:bank:savings]          $2.00
    [equity:adjust]               $-2.00

2026-01-31 month-end statement checks
    assets:bank:checking           $0.00 = $220.25
    assets:bank:savings            $0.00 =* $5,182.00
    assets:bank                    $0.00 =* $5,402.25

2026-01-31 a wrong assertion
    assets:bank:checking           $0.00 = $300.00

2026-01-31 total assertion, EUR left over
    assets:bank:checking           $0.00 == $220.25

2026-02-01 untouched by the subtree
    expenses:food                 $10.00
    liabilities:card

2026-02-03 euros back out
    assets:bank:checking       -150,00 EUR = 0,00 EUR
    expenses:travel             150,00 EUR

include sub.journal
